Package: sisura-base-files
Version: @SISURA_RELEASE@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: The Sisura Authors <packages@sisura.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: required
Depends: base-files
Description: Sisura Linux release identification
 Identifies the system as Sisura Linux @SISURA_RELEASE@ (based on Debian
 @SISURA_CODENAME@) through /usr/lib/os-release. ID_LIKE=debian keeps tools
 that look for Debian working.
 .
 Debian's os-release is kept as /usr/lib/os-release.debian (dpkg-divert)
 and restored when this package is removed.
